  "boundary": "The selected DamageUnit second list context joins List<DamageProcessorBase>; first CostData and third GameplayTag lists are separate. Pinned union table entries 0/9 select AttackCriticalRateProcessorForMemoryPack and InstantModifyAttributeForMemoryPack. Their readers consume header1/scalar-payload and header2/AttributeModifier/raw DWORD respectively; exact contexts reuse the separately pinned BlackboardDouble and AttributeModifier profiles in buff_root_prefix_native.json. Short/extended union tags, null unions and null wrappers are distinct. The second list reserves the shortest 42-byte remaining DamageUnit tail; unknown processor tags stop before the tag. Static identities are exact and selected leaf source order direct; framing remains structural-only and conditional on the previously pinned shared reference-list consumer. Live inflated provider selection, complete refill/error and allocation parity, arithmetic/attribute behavior, scalar meaning and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved. First/third positive unit lists and the effect array remain unsupported; unselected CalculationBase variants retain their separate boundary."
